xtras, 024G}' \"\" --allow-not-applicable\ntests/check_invocation_log/test_check_invocation_log_entry.sh:641:  run_case \"$repo_dir\" 2 '' 'ERROR: --allow-not-applicable requires --tooling-slice-id <id> where <id> ∈ {024A, 024B-core, 024B-extras, 024G}' \"\" --allow-not-applicable --tooling-slice-id 024C\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
